# MSBuild reads this file for every build started in this repository: dotnet build, dotnet test,
# dotnet publish and msbuild, from a script or by hand, for any project or solution below this folder.
#
# Node reuse is OFF here. With it on (the MSBuild default) each build leaves its worker nodes running
# to serve a next build. Agents build this repository from many worktrees at once, the next build
# rarely reuses the same nodes, and the idle ones piled up into gigabytes on the build machine.
# The measured cost is about 2.6 seconds on a multi-project build after a one-file change.
-nodeReuse:false
